              <text x="372" y="136" fill="#1e293b" font-size="9" text-anchor="middle">Between Rabi &amp; Kharif</text>
              <text x="372" y="160" fill="#15803d" font-size="8.5" font-weight="bold" text-anchor="middle">Watermelon, Melon</text>
